Today is Tuesday.
I have just returned to my apartment from the gym.
On Tuesday evenings, I usually relax.
After working out, I sit on the sofa and read a book.
But today I am not going to read a book.
Today I have to complete a very boring task.
I need to update my local electricity account details.
I usually put off such tasks.
Because I get very bored by such online tasks.
But today I am definitely going to finish this task.
I open the door and come into the house.
I put my gym bag to one side.
Then I drink a glass of water and sit on the sofa.
Today I want to see how information is updated on a government website.
I take my mobile phone in my hand.
Now I am going to start this task.
